Over its six-year history, Lockular has generated approximately GBP 1 million in revenue. The majority of its operations have been focused on research and development, with trial implementations tailored to two distinct use cases for two separate customers.

The request is for additional investment to enhance access to filesystem provenance information embedded in the blockchain, including automated analysis and reporting by AI bots. Further adaptations are needed to manage large binary objects and to launch a direct key store service based on principles similar (but with provenance) to OnePassword. Improvements to simplify the onboarding process are also sought.